{"id":"3ac630427c1d6d52","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel.md","title":"Boolos Four-World Tableau Countermodel","display":"ex-gl-tableau-countermodel — Boolos Four-World Tableau Countermodel","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel","aliases":["89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel"],"display":"ex-gl-tableau-countermodel — Boolos Four-World Tableau Countermodel","depends_on":["[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-gl-tableau-countermodel — Boolos Four-World Tableau Countermodel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd488da32dcaca7b\" href=\"?note=cd488da32dcaca7b\" title=\"89-df-gl-tree-frame\">89-df-gl-tree-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLTree}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLTree}\\)</span> 是有限有根 GL 树框架谓词，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd488da32dcaca7b\" href=\"?note=cd488da32dcaca7b\" title=\"89-df-gl-tree-frame\">89-df-gl-tree-frame</a> 的签名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\Box(p\\lor\\Box p)\\to(\\Box p\\lor\\Box\\Box p)\">\\(A=\\Box(p\\lor\\Box p)\\to(\\Box p\\lor\\Box\\Box p)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{0,1,2,3\\}\">\\(W=\\{0,1,2,3\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{(0,1),(0,2),(2,3),(0,3)\\}\">\\(R=\\{(0,1),(0,2),(2,3),(0,3)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p)=\\{2\\}\">\\(V(p)=\\{2\\}\\)</span>，其余字母的真值集为空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land\nM,0\\models\\Box(p\\lor\\Box p)\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box p\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box\\Box p\\land M,0\\not\\models A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land\nM,0\\models\\Box(p\\lor\\Box p)\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box p\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box\\Box p\\land M,0\\not\\models A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.139–141。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>原书 Example 2。世界 1、3 为终端，故其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 真；世界 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 真，所以三个根后继均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\lor\\Box p\">\\(p\\lor\\Box p\\)</span>。后继 1 反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>；后继 2 的后继 3 反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，所以后继 2 反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span>。根的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\Box p\">\\(\\Box\\Box p\\)</span> 因而均假。包含边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,3)\">\\((0,3)\\)</span> 才是传递闭包，不能只保留图示中的父子边。</p>\n<p>这是具体反模型，不是对带任意公式参数的模式作肯定断言。四个世界也可由开放窗口分支提取。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-tree-frame","status":"resolved","id":"cd488da32dcaca7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-tree-frame","status":"resolved","id":"cd488da32dcaca7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLTree}$ 是有限有根 GL 树框架谓词，取 [[89-df-gl-tree-frame]] 的签名。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLTree}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\Box(p\\lor\\Box p)\\to(\\Box p\\lor\\Box\\Box p)","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\{0,1,2,3\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{(0,1),(0,2),(2,3),(0,3)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V(p)=\\{2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R))\\land\nM,0\\models\\Box(p\\lor\\Box p)\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box p\\land\nM,0\\not\\models\\Box\\Box p\\land M,0\\not\\models A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p\\lor\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"(0,3)","display":false}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反模型：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel]]。命题优先条件及旧任意次序的反例：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。关系树与高度界：[[89-thm-gl-tree-completeness]]。K 的补充：[[89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-k-lob-rule]]。"}],"outgoing":["9f00301866fbd6f0","cd488da32dcaca7b"]}